    <!-- Tabla completa en bronce, plata u oro -->
    <string name="el_mastery_table_bronze_title">Bronze table!</string>
    <string name="el_mastery_table_bronze_body1">All 118 elements, five times each. It\'s not luck anymore: it\'s method.</string>
    <string name="el_mastery_table_bronze_body2">Silver awaits. Every Pomodoro keeps adding up.</string>
    <string name="el_mastery_table_silver_title">Silver table!</string>
    <string name="el_mastery_table_silver_body1">Ten times every element. By now your lab has more experience than most.</string>
    <string name="el_mastery_table_silver_body2">Only gold is left: the level of those who turn consistency into habit.</string>
    <string name="el_mastery_table_gold_title">Gold table!</string>
    <string name="el_mastery_table_gold_body1">Fifteen times each of the 118 elements. What alchemists chased for centuries, turning things into gold, you achieved with time and focus.</string>
    <string name="el_mastery_table_gold_body2">You reached the top of this lab. What you built here, the habit of focusing, is yours now and goes with you into everything you do.</string>
    <string name="el_mastery_table_gold_body3">Thank you for every Pomodoro.</string>
    <string name="el_mastery_table_confirm">Let\'s keep going!</string>
    <string name="el_signature">— JJAS and the koala</string>

    <!-- Tabla periódica completa -->
    <string name="el_table_complete_title">You completed the periodic table!</string>
    <string name="el_table_complete_body1">All %1$d elements. Each one came from your focus time: from hours when you chose to concentrate while it was easier to get distracted.</string>
    <string name="el_table_complete_body2">Mendeleev spent years ordering this table, and generations of scientists devoted their lives to finding every square. You filled it one Pomodoro at a time, and even made the ones that don\'t exist in nature in your synthesizer.</string>
    <string name="el_table_complete_body3">This isn\'t just a collection: it\'s proof that consistency transforms. Just as these elements make up everything that exists, your hours of focus are shaping the person you want to be.</string>
    <string name="el_table_complete_body4">Thank you for letting this little lab keep you company. We\'re still here for whatever comes next.</string>
    <string name="el_table_complete_confirm">Thanks, koala</string>
</resources>
